{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01443",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.5,
      "end_seconds": 5.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Right, hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.54,
      "end_seconds": 10.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.59,
      "end_seconds": 20.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.48,
      "text": "Ah, you know, doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.59,
      "end_seconds": 26.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 28.36,
      "end_seconds": 33.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Doctor, it's crushing chest pain. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.21,
      "end_seconds": 38.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Alright, tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 39.13,
      "end_seconds": 42.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "She takes valsartan, 80 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.53,
      "end_seconds": 70.72,
      "duration_seconds": 9.19,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.19,
      "end_seconds": 81.43,
      "duration_seconds": 9.24,
      "text": "Yes, exertion. That makes it worse. I'd say moderate. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.46,
      "end_seconds": 84.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.34,
      "end_seconds": 105.26,
      "duration_seconds": 18.92,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get pain going into my left arm as well. I've also been feeling sick, since last weekend. Ah, about feeling sick, about a eight out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.22,
      "end_seconds": 109.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Have you been sweating?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.55,
      "end_seconds": 132.17,
      "duration_seconds": 17.62,
      "text": "Mm, yes. As for sweating, it just comes and goes. As for pain going into my left arm, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.13,
      "end_seconds": 143.35,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.41,
      "end_seconds": 160.09,
      "duration_seconds": 15.68,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, it happens once or twice a day. About a six out of ten. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.35,
      "end_seconds": 166.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Okay, a few quick ones: fever, leg swelling or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.14,
      "end_seconds": 171.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Okay, so no, no fever, leg swelling or cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.94,
      "end_seconds": 180.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.52,
      "end_seconds": 186.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.04,
      "end_seconds": 190.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.29,
      "end_seconds": 192.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.08,
      "end_seconds": 201.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.9,
      "end_seconds": 207.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 207.83,
      "end_seconds": 214.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "Hold on, doctor, I think she reacted to trimethoprim once. I'm not certain, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.2,
      "end_seconds": 218.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Really? I don't think so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.4,
      "end_seconds": 228.78,
      "duration_seconds": 8.38,
      "text": "Okay, I'll note both of those. Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.5,
      "end_seconds": 247.45,
      "duration_seconds": 17.95,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. My husband and I live above the shop. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.72,
      "end_seconds": 262.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.7,
      "end_seconds": 270.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Ah, yes, I had a varicose vein procedure, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.64,
      "end_seconds": 275.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.91,
      "end_seconds": 285.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.65,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.37,
      "end_seconds": 290.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.88,
      "end_seconds": 304.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.79,
      "end_seconds": 327.93,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 129 over 80, pulse 111, SpO2 98 percent on room air, temperature is 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.52,
      "end_seconds": 334.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.59,
      "end_seconds": 337.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.56,
      "end_seconds": 355.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "You are pale and sweaty, and your pulse is fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.86,
      "end_seconds": 359.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.06,
      "end_seconds": 406.51,
      "duration_seconds": 30.45,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? It points towards a possible heart attack. I can't rule out unstable angina yet. We should do a troponin blood test for chest pain. I want an ECG done, that's for chest pain. I'm prescribing aspirin, 300 milligrams, once now, single dose. That should help with possible heart attack. Stay lying down and do not eat or drink."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 408.36,
      "end_seconds": 424.78,
      "duration_seconds": 16.42,
      "text": "Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. If the pain returns, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. I'll want another look straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.05,
      "end_seconds": 427.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "I can manage that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 428.48,
      "end_seconds": 435.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 436.88,
      "end_seconds": 445.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "So, I take the aspirin, 300 milligrams, once now and come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 447.7,
      "end_seconds": 452.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 453.56,
      "end_seconds": 457.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}